Managing and tracking code changes manually during website development can lead to 
confusion and data loss. Version Control Systems (VCS) like Mercurial and Git help 
automate this process by keeping track of all versions of the source code, enabling developers 
to revert, merge or synchronize changes easily. 
Using Mercurial 
Procedure: 
1. Install Mercurial: 
 Download and install from https://www.mercurial-scm.org. 
