hg commit -m "Updated homepage content" 
7. View Repository Status and History: 
 Check modified files:  
hg status 
 View commit history:  
hg log 
8. Create a Remote Repository: 
 Use Bitbucket (supports Mercurial) or a self-hosted repository. 
